Elon Musk at the Kennedy Center in Washington in November. He exchanged multiple messages with Mr. Epstein, the documents show.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/30/us/elon-musk-epstein-emails.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 Jan 2026 09:11:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Spending Deal Leaves Government in Shutdown Limbo for the Weekend</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/30/us/politics/senate-vote-shutdown-ice.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
