A rally in Minneapolis on Friday. The Senate passed a spending package to continue funding the Department of Homeland Security for two weeks while Democrats negotiate with President Trump on restrictions to the administration’s immigration enforcement measures.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/30/us/politics/senate-vote-shutdown-ice.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 Jan 2026 05:13:47 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Epstein Offered Prince Andrew a Meeting With a Russian Woman, Emails Show</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/30/us/politics/epstein-prince-andrew.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/01/30/multimedia/30epstein-files-blog-epstein-prince-andrew1-qjvz/30epstein-files-blog-epstein-prince-andrew1-qjvz-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" alt="Article image"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
Britain’s former Prince Andrew at the Sandringham estate in England in 2022. The documents reveal more about his well-known relationship with Mr. Epstein.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/30/us/politics/epstein-prince-andrew.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 Jan 2026 08:51:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Here’s What to Know About the Millions of Pages of Epstein Documents</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/30/us/what-to-know-epstein-files.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
