The Justice Department released millions of new pages related to the convicted sex offender Jeffrey Epstein.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/30/us/what-to-know-epstein-files.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 Jan 2026 08:03:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Search Suspended for 6 Missing in Boat Off the Coast of Massachusetts</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/30/us/fishing-boat-missing-massachusetts.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
