A fishing boat that left from Gloucester, Mass., on Friday was reported missing off the coast of Massachusetts, the U.S. Coast Guard said.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/30/us/fishing-boat-missing-massachusetts.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 Jan 2026 07:53:07 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Draft Epstein Indictment Accused Him of Crimes Against More Than a Dozen Girls</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/30/us/politics/epstein-2007-draft-indictment.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
