In 2019, the F.B.I. announced new sex trafficking charges against Jeffrey Epstein, the disgraced financier.
]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/30/us/politics/epstein-2007-draft-indictment.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 30 Jan 2026 18:41:47 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Should Any Programs Help Minority Groups? In Lawsuits, Conservatives Say No.</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/31/us/politics/affirmative-action-ruling-dei-lawsuits.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
